{"id":"n29013-1-7","stage":2,"title":"진행자 · 主持人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29013-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 행사의 진행자가 재치 있는 사람이었어.","zh":"今天的活动主持人真是个风趣的人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행사의","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진행자가","meaning":"主持人","explanation":"진행자：主持人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"진행자","audio":"/audio/78f98e56e0f2ccfd13c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29013","senseId":"1","lemma":"진행자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재치","meaning":"才华，才气","explanation":"재치：才华，才气","readings":[{"term":"재치","audio":"/audio/82229868b5fb09e79125.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74374","senseId":"1","lemma":"재치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"是，当，担任","explanation":"있다：是，当，担任；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"17","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이었어.","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"9","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3","entryId":"72482","definition":"有目的或计划地按程序做某事；或指该事。","pronunciation":["행사"]},{"id":"78f98e56e0f2ccfd","term":"진행자","zh":"主持人","audio":"/audio/78f98e56e0f2ccfd13c9.mp3","entryId":"29013","definition":"主持活动、电视广播节目等领头做事的人。","pronunciation":["진ː행자"]},{"id":"82229868b5fb09e7","term":"재치","zh":"才华，才气","audio":"/audio/82229868b5fb09e79125.mp3","entryId":"74374","definition":"有眼力地熟练地处理某事的才能。","pronunciation":["재치"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"是，当，担任","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人以某个职位或角色的状态存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"出众的人物。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6612ad8a6ae61795632.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29013-1-7-2","ko":"맞아. 진행자 덕분에 아주 즐거웠어.","zh":"对啊，多亏了主持人，我们玩得非常开心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진행자","meaning":"主持人","explanation":"진행자：主持人","readings":[{"term":"진행자","audio":"/audio/78f98e56e0f2ccfd13c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29013","senseId":"1","lemma":"진행자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"즐거웠어.","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"78f98e56e0f2ccfd","term":"진행자","zh":"主持人","audio":"/audio/78f98e56e0f2ccfd13c9.mp3","entryId":"29013","definition":"主持活动、电视广播节目等领头做事的人。","pronunciation":["진ː행자"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]}],"audio":"/audio/671777bae05f7bcc908f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29013","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.1953,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊，多亏了主持人，我们玩得非常开心。","去大田的话，要在哪里转弯呢？","今天的活动主持人真是个风趣的人啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对啊，多亏了主持人，我们玩得非常开心。","今天的活动主持人真是个风趣的人啊。","去大田的话，要在哪里转弯呢？"],"answer":0}]}
